          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard is the better choice for most buyers: about $1.44 per 25 g of protein, an NSF Certified for Sport listing on two flavors, 24 flavors to choose from and a Label Score of 78/100. Its 3 g of carbohydrate and 1 g of sugar are a small price for saving roughly 42% per gram.
